      "npc" : "Interdimensional Device",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do not use the teleporter.",
      "translation" : "不使用傳送裝置。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Interdimensional Device",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Use the teleporter to move to the Demon God's hideout.",
      "translation" : "使用傳送裝置前往魔神的藏身處。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How may I help you?",
      "translation" : "我能為你做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What's that teleporter?",
      "translation" : "那個傳送裝置是做什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why is it so crowded in here?",
      "translation" : "這裡為什麼這麼擁擠？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Demon God's hideout?",
      "translation" : "魔神的藏身處？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Goodbye.",
      "translation" : "再見。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's connected to the recently discovered hideout the of Demon God.",
      "translation" : "它連線著最近發現的魔神藏身處。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's scientifically designed to send its user directly to the Dimensional Crack where his hideout is.",
      "translation" : "這是經過科學設計的裝置，可以將使用者直接送到魔神藏身處所在的次元裂隙。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Many a warrior already left to the hideout.",
      "translation" : "已經有許多戰士前往藏身處了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So long as Morocc exists, Yggdrasil is not safe. I'm going to join the Expedition.",
      "translation" : "只要摩洛克還在，世界樹就不安全。我要加入遠征隊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It turns out Demon God ran from Morocc to hide out in our dimension.",
      "translation" : "原來魔神從摩洛克逃到我們的次元躲藏了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He has to be dealt with, either banished back to his realm or destroyed.",
      "translation" : "必須對付他：要麼把他驅逐回自己的領域，要麼徹底消滅他。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you want to join the Expedition to defeat the Demon God, then use this teleporter.",
      "translation" : "如果你想加入討伐魔神的遠征隊，就使用這個傳送裝置。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It'll send you directly to the Expedition Camp.",
      "translation" : "它會直接把你送到遠征營地。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You know the Dimensional Crack, don't you? Recently it's been revealed that the Crack is made up of dimensional passageways.",
      "translation" : "你知道次元裂隙吧？最近我們發現，裂隙由許多次元通道構成。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We can now use those passageways to explore inside the Crack.",
      "translation" : "現在我們可以利用這些通道，探索裂隙內部。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Originally the Crack was created by the Demon God to aid in his escape,",
      "translation" : "裂隙原本是魔神為逃跑而創造的，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "so it'd been thought investigating the Crack could locate him.",
      "translation" : "所以大家曾認為調查裂隙就能找到他。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And it was; finally his hideout has been discovered.",
      "translation" : "結果確實如此；我們終於發現了他的藏身處。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "His traces and his demon soldiers are sighted mainly around the giant hill in the center.",
      "translation" : "主要在中央那座巨大山丘附近發現了他的蹤跡和惡魔士兵。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you want more details, then you should visit the actual site.",
      "translation" : "想了解更多詳情，就去現場看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Just use the teleporter over there.",
      "translation" : "使用那邊的傳送裝置就行。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]",
      "translation" : "[艾克拉吉守衛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "May Yggdrasil bless you.",
      "translation" : "願世界樹保佑你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[戰鬥拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm nervous.",
      "translation" : "我好緊張。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[戰鬥拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I hope I can return in one piece.",
      "translation" : "希望我能全須全尾地回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[戰鬥拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[戰鬥拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Shush.",
      "translation" : "噓。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[戰鬥拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mwa hah hah, it's time for me to shine!",
      "translation" : "哇哈哈哈，該我大顯身手了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[戰鬥拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I must have been out of my mind when I decided to join the army. Sigh, why does the Door to Verities have to be so high up there?",
      "translation" : "我當初決定參軍時一定是瘋了。唉，真理之門為什麼要建得那麼高？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Commander Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[拉菲內隊長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Evil must be nipped in the butt.",
      "translation" : "邪惡必須趁早剷除。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You're unexpected visitors from the Midgard Continent.",
      "translation" : "你們是從米德加爾特大陸來的意外訪客。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Commander Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[拉菲內隊長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you  are the cause doom to ourselves OR Yggdrasil, then we won't hesitate to fight you.",
      "translation" : "如果你們會危及我們自己或世界樹，我們絕不會手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lemony]",
      "translation" : "[檸檬妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Did you read the latest issue of the Door to Verities magazine?",
      "translation" : "你看了最新一期《真理之門》雜誌嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Was Avant's new teleporter really featured in it?",
      "translation" : "阿凡特的新傳送裝置真的登上雜誌了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Armandi]",
      "translation" : "[阿曼蒂]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, just the basic principles and the information relevant to the Humans.",
      "translation" : "是的，只介紹了基本原理，以及與人類相關的資訊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I didn't quite understand it all.",
      "translation" : "我沒太看懂。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lemony]",
      "translation" : "[檸檬妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I wonder if this means Avant has finally decided to pursue his interest in research activities.",
      "translation" : "不知道阿凡特是不是終於決定投身研究了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lemony]",
      "translation" : "[檸檬妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hey, Human.",
      "translation" : "嘿，人類。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Were you eavesdropping on us? Well, though it wasn't like we're discussing secrets.",
      "translation" : "你在偷聽我們說話嗎？不過我們聊的也不是什麼秘密。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lemony]",
      "translation" : "[檸檬妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, right. Are you too going there?",
      "translation" : "對了，你也要去那裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You know, the hideout of the Demon God who created some of the Space Time Dimensional Cracks has recently been discovered.",
      "translation" : "你知道，最近發現了創造部分時空次元裂隙的魔神藏身處。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lemony]",
      "translation" : "[檸檬妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you're curious, then use that teleporter to the hideout over there.",
      "translation" : "好奇的話，就用那邊的傳送裝置前往藏身處吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There will be quite a spectacle to watch.",
      "translation" : "那裡會有一場好戲看。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, just so you know, you might be throwing away your life. *Giggle*",
